# "This spell can't be countered." Bot2 holds Counterspell and mana on turn 3 (Island and Mox Sapphire, untouched on its own
# turn 2) and counters Frenzied Baloth as Bot1 casts it: the Counterspell resolves, the Baloth still enters. (Counterspell
# does counter the noncreature spell in frenzied-baloth-makes-creature-spells-uncounterable-but-not-other-spells.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Frenzied Baloth
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Counterspell
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Frenzied Baloth.Cast
? Stack = Frenzied Baloth
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Counterspell.Cast(Frenzied Baloth)
? Stack = Counterspell; Frenzied Baloth
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Frenzied Baloth
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Counterspell
